          <h2>Lifecycle stage setup checklist</h2>
          <div class="guide-checklist"><div class="guide-check"><span>✓</span><div>Lifecycle stage and lead status kept separate</div></div><div class="guide-check"><span>✓</span><div>Entry and exit criteria written per stage</div></div><div class="guide-check"><span>✓</span><div>Definitions signed off by marketing and sales</div></div><div class="guide-check"><span>✓</span><div>Owner named for each stage</div></div><div class="guide-check"><span>✓</span><div>Default stage set on every entry point</div></div><div class="guide-check"><span>✓</span><div>Backward moves documented</div></div><div class="guide-check"><span>✓</span><div>Stage entry dates captured</div></div><div class="guide-check"><span>✓</span><div>Funnel report built on agreed stages</div></div></div>
        </section>
        <div class="guide-callout"><p><strong>Key takeaway:</strong> Lifecycle stage is the relationship, lead status is the work. Define both in writing and the funnel report stops being an argument.</p></div>
